    "text": "<div class=creature>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-title\"><span>{{!!title}}</span><span>3级 杂兵 游击</span></div>\n<div class=bg-title><span>中型 自然界 类人生物</span><span>XP {{!!xp}}</span></div>\n<div><span>''HP'' 1；失手攻击无法伤害杂兵</span><span>''先攻'' +4</span></div>\n<div><span>''AC'' 17，''强韧'' 15，''反射'' 16，''意志'' 15</span><span>''侦查'' +3</span></div>\n<div><span>''速度'' 6</span><span>''感官'' 昏暗视觉</span></div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">特性</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">群体效应</div>\n<div class=description>天狗恶棍在夹击时获得的加值是+3 而不是+2，且它在援助他人时提供的加值是+3 而不是+2。</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">模仿</div>\n<div class=description>天狗恶棍可以模仿声响和声音。听者用洞察检定对抗该天狗恶棍的唬骗检定成功可以觉察到<br>这个效果是伪装的。</div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">标准动作</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">{{$:/dnd/images/meleebasic}}木棒（武器）✦随意</div>\n<div class=description>攻击：+8 vs. AC<br>命中：5 点伤害。</div>\n<div class=\"italic bg-flavortext\">（天狗）</div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span style=flex-basis:auto>''技能'' 隐秘+9</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''力量'' 12（+2）</span><span>''敏捷'' 17（+4）</span><span>''感知'' 14（+3）</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''体质'' 14（+3）</span><span>''智力'' 9（+0）</span><span>''魅力'' 11（+1）</span></div></div>\n<div><div class=\"ability\"><span>''阵营'' 无</span><span style=flex-basis:auto>''语言'' 通用语</span></div></div>\n<div><div class=\"ability\"><span style=flex-basis:auto>''装备'' 皮甲，木棒</span></div></div>\n</div>",
